@startuml Figure5_4_Station_Verification_Workflow
!theme plain

title "Figure 5.4: Station Data Contribution & Field Verification Workflow"

|==1. Station Proposal Submission==|
:EV User or Collaborator\nsubmits station proposal\n(CREATE_STATION or UPDATE_STATION);
:#LightBlue:System creates **Change Request**\nstatus = DRAFT\n+ creates Station Version (DRAFT);
:User calls submitChangeRequest();
:**Risk Engine** assessChangeRequest()\ncalculates riskScore + riskReasons;
:Change Request status = PENDING\n+ Station Version status = PENDING;
|#PaleTurquoise:Audit log: SUBMIT_CHANGE_REQUEST\n(riskScore, riskLevel, riskReasons);

|==2. Risk Gate==|
if (riskScore >= 60?) then (Yes\nHIGH RISK)
  :System creates **Verification Task** (OPEN)\n+ generates checklist from riskReasons\n+ stores station snapshot;
  :Admin assigns task to Collaborator;
  :Collaborator receives notification\n(TASK_ASSIGNED);
  note right
    **Collaborator travels to station**
    GPS check-in: ST_Distance(collaborator, station) <= 200m
    If > 200m → REJECTED
  end note
  :Collaborator performs\n**GPS Check-in** at site;
  if (distance <= 200m?) then (No)
    :System rejects check-in\n"Too far from station";
  endif
  :Collaborator answers **Checklist**\n(Yes / No / Unable to Verify\n+ mandatory supplementary note\nif No or Unable);
  :Collaborator uploads\n**Evidence Photos** to MinIO;
  :Verification Task status = SUBMITTED;
  :Admin receives notification;
  :Admin **Reviews Task**\n(PASS or FAIL);
  if (Result = PASS?) then (Yes)
    :Trust score recalculate (+20);
    :Admin **Approves** Change Request;
  else (No)
    :Trust score recalculate (-20);
    :Admin **Rejects** Change Request\n→ Station Version = REJECTED;
    detach
  endif
else (No\nLOW/MEDIUM RISK)
  :Admin **Approves** Change Request\n(no verification required);
endif

|==3. Publish Decision==|
if (CR status = APPROVED?) then (Yes)
  if (riskScore >= 60 AND\nverification PASS?) then (Yes)
    :Admin **Publishes** Change Request;
  else (No)
    :System **BLOCKS** publish\n"High-risk CR requires\nverification PASS first";
    detach
  endif
else (No\nREJECTED)
  :Station Version = REJECTED;
  detach
endif

|==4. Publish Execution==|
note right
  **Atomic publish operation**
  Pessimistic lock on station row
  (prevents concurrent publish)
end note
:System **Archives** old published version\n→ status = ARCHIVED;
:System **Publishes** new version\n→ status = PUBLISHED + publishedAt;
:System **Creates Charger Units**\nfrom charging ports;
:System **Applies Battery Swap config**\nif BATTERY_SWAP service exists;
:Change Request status = PUBLISHED;
|#PaleTurquoise:Audit log: PUBLISH_STATION_VERSION;
:**Trust score recalculates**\n(base + bonuses + penalties);
:Submitter receives notification\n(CR is live);
stop

legend right
  **Color Legend:**
  #LightBlue = System action (Creation)
  #PaleTurquoise = Audit logging
end legend

@enduml
